# PenguinBox — machine-local environment (TEMPLATE — committed, no real values)
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored, see .gitignore) and fill in the real
# values. `.env.local` never leaves the dev machine: this repo is PUBLIC, and
# rig/connection details must never be committed or pushed (AGENTS.md H-8).
# When you add a key here, add it to your `.env.local` too — and vice versa.
#
# Tokens in <angle brackets> are placeholders — replace them with real values.

RIG_SSH_USER=<user>
RIG_SSH_HOST=<rig-lan-ip>
RIG_SSH=<user>@<rig-lan-ip>          # usage: ssh "$RIG_SSH"

# Free-form notes an agent may need (auth method, quirks) go below as comments.
